{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1539575-writing-fan-fiction-set-in-the-world-of-scion-2e","id":1539575,"title":"Writing (fan)fiction set in the World of Scion 2E","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-30T21:23:57-07:00","id":1539575,"title":"Writing (fan)fiction set in the World of Scion 2E","content":"I'm contemplating writing a fanfic set in the World. Following a Band of demigods, based off either one of the many books I have. &quot;Scion High,&quot; &quot;Bring Forth a Greater Thunder,&quot; &quot;No Gods No Masters,&quot; etcetera. So how do I go about it?<br /> <br /> More specifically, how do I figure which storyline(s)/decisions to choose without a dice roll? Should I still use Legend within the story for use of powers? Should I still use dots when I'm planning characters? There's more questions, but I want to find someone to ask.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28562-ofgreenprydain","name":"OfGreenPrydain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-15T07:02:16-07:00","id":1540428,"title":"","content":"My biggest advice is to thoroughly read the fiction sections in each book, and read whichever Scion-specific fictions out there.<br /> <br /> On making decision with/without dice rolls or using dots when planning characters, I say go wild. Pick whichever option you think is easiest to write. If you want the adventure to feel more authentic, use the dice. If you want the story to go in a certain direction, call the shots yourself. If you want your characters to feel more complete as well as noting down which abilities/powers that your characters have, feel free to write down character sheets for them.<br /> <br /> Just keep in mind that you're not writing about a Scion campaign, you're writing a piece of original fiction that uses Scion as its setting - Does the knowledge of Legend exist in-universe? What about Callings? Knacks and Boons? Like, sure the players and the Storytellers might call them that, but do the in-universe people even understand what those concepts are beyond manifestations of divine power? Hel, when it comes to a good story, not even the rules are necessary, so feel free to bend them or just ignore them flat out if it means writing the story you want into fruition.<br /> <br /> Aside from that, just make sure to avoid typical RPG-turned-fiction pit holes, like &quot;you had to be there&quot; humor, or focusing too much on the world-building when there's not even a single emotional core to your characters or narratives, or expecting readers to connect with a character you adore because they've been with <i>you</i> for ages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27963-jayng2183","name":"JayNg2183","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27963_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-15T10:57:54-07:00","id":1540440,"title":"","content":"In addition to the fiction in the rpg books there\u2019s also this anthology on DriveThruFiction. <a href=\"https://www.drivethrufiction.com/product/375569/Scion-Tales-of-Heroes--A-Scion-Anthology?affiliate_id=1664029\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrufiction.com/pro...ate_id=1664029</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-19T19:28:45-07:00","id":1540742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JayNg2183</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1539575-writing-fan-fiction-set-in-the-world-of-scion-2e?p=1540428#post1540428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My biggest advice is to thoroughly read the fiction sections in each book, and read whichever Scion-specific fictions out there.<br /> <br /> On making decision with/without dice rolls or using dots when planning characters, I say go wild. Pick whichever option you think is easiest to write. If you want the adventure to feel more authentic, use the dice. If you want the story to go in a certain direction, call the shots yourself. If you want your characters to feel more complete as well as noting down which abilities/powers that your characters have, feel free to write down character sheets for them.<br /> <br /> Just keep in mind that you're not writing about a Scion campaign, you're writing a piece of original fiction that uses Scion as its setting - Does the knowledge of Legend exist in-universe? What about Callings? Knacks and Boons? Like, sure the players and the Storytellers might call them that, but do the in-universe people even understand what those concepts are beyond manifestations of divine power? Hel, when it comes to a good story, not even the rules are necessary, so feel free to bend them or just ignore them flat out if it means writing the story you want into fruition.<br /> <br /> Aside from that, just make sure to avoid typical RPG-turned-fiction pit holes, like &quot;you had to be there&quot; humor, or focusing too much on the world-building when there's not even a single emotional core to your characters or narratives, or expecting readers to connect with a character you adore because they've been with <i>you</i> for ages.</div> </div> </div> </div>You don't gotta worry about that from me, chief. Barely even played any campaigns yet. Hell, I'll probably end up making Scion characters exclusive to my writings alone. Will use bits and pieces of the character creation to help keep track of what abilities I give em. Make sure they don't get too overpowered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28562-ofgreenprydain","name":"OfGreenPrydain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-19T19:29:26-07:00","id":1540743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1539575-writing-fan-fiction-set-in-the-world-of-scion-2e?p=1540440#post1540440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In addition to the fiction in the rpg books there\u2019s also this anthology on DriveThruFiction. <a href=\"https://www.drivethrufiction.com/product/375569/Scion-Tales-of-Heroes--A-Scion-Anthology?affiliate_id=1664029\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrufiction.com/pro...ate_id=1664029</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I actually bought that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28562-ofgreenprydain","name":"OfGreenPrydain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}